        "例2　要求作出函数$y=-\\frac{1}{4}x^2-x+4$的图象."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们求出抛物线顶点的坐标. 根据公式$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$求横坐",
        "标，得到：$x=-\\frac{-1}{2\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)}=-2$. 由等式$y=-\\frac{1}{4}(-2)^2-↵(-2)+4$求出顶点的纵坐标等于5."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
